dialect protocol
protocol wfc.grid3d.mutations
version 1
schema wfc.grid3d.mutations
start record
framing record

# Real op frame (`dsl::variants_binary::encode_tagged_op`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag varint`,
# then the kind's framework record body (`os_pack::encode_record_body`). Each record is one mutation kind at its
# wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, which the codec looks up by the kind's keyword.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag varint
record change-seed tag=0
field body bytes
record resize-grid tag=1
field body bytes
record change-cell-sizes tag=2
field body bytes
record change-periodicity tag=3
field body bytes
record create-tile tag=4
field body bytes
record delete-tile tag=5
field body bytes
record change-tile-weight tag=6
field body bytes
record change-tile-media tag=7
field body bytes
record create-rule tag=8
field body bytes
record delete-rule tag=9
field body bytes
record pin-cell tag=10
field body bytes
record unpin-cell tag=11
field body bytes
record mask-cell tag=12
field body bytes
record unmask-cell tag=13
field body bytes
